Sunshine Coast Council and Healthy Sunshine Coast bring present community dance to the Sunshine Coast. This class is the first class for the Afro Pop classes which are held in Coolum at the Coolum Civic Centre every Sunday from 10.30am.

If you are interested in joining the class, this Sunday will be your last opportunity that council will take bookings. Classes are $5 each or $20 for the 4 weeks.

In Afro Pop we are dancing to Sidiki Diabate and the song is Na Ki Toucher. This routine is a blend of West African dance moves and Afro beat grooves. Classes are for adults, are fun and high energy. Come join us and experience the joy of community dance!!
